Learning Order

For you specifically:

✅ Generic Base API
✅ Response Validator
✅ Logger
✅ Utility Classes
✅ Retry Mechanism
✅ AJV Schema Utility
✅ Professional Folder Structure
✅ Docker
✅ Jenkins

Ye complete kar loge to interview mein confidently bol sakte ho:

"I built a Playwright TypeScript API framework using BaseAPI abstraction, DTOs, custom validators, AJV schema validation, fixtures, logging, retry strategy, utility classes, token management, and GitHub Actions CI/CD integration."









